                                                "sense_id": "120a1d06-080e-3667-a824-e0749aac6a20",
                                                "text": "He located a doctor in Brooklyn who was a writing fool. This croaker would go three scripts a day for as high as thirty tablets a script."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b02a4e45-7112-499a-9fdf-0112bfacf1ae",
                                                "sense_id": "120a1d06-080e-3667-a824-e0749aac6a20",
                                                "text": "Shit, he got the scripts for the cough / In the H, gotta hit Johnny for the frost, swerved off"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "682d6f8d-a0f9-47dc-b34c-0a3557db99da",
                                                "sense_id": "120a1d06-080e-3667-a824-e0749aac6a20",
                                                "text": "She gave me a Bipolar II diagnosis and a script for epilepsy medicine that could be used off-label in cases like mine."
                                            }
